GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?category=就職活動

### 1. 1件登録する
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "業界研究",
  "category": "マーケティング",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-01"
}

### 2. 1件取得する
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/99


### 3. 1件更新する
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "競合サイトを5つ調べる",
  "detail": null,
  "category": "マーケティング",
  "priority": 2,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-01",
  "completed": false
}

### 4. 1件削除する
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### 5. 祝日を直接取ってくる
GET https://holidays-jp.github.io/api/v1/date.json

### 6. 自分のアプリの祝日API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/holidays

### 7. 期限で絞り込む
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?from=2026-04-01&to=2026-04-30

### 8. Todoを全件取得
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos

### 9. 2026年10月のTodoだけ取得
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31

### 10. MCPの窓口を確かめる
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp

### 11. 窓口と会話を始める
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-06-18",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "requests.http",
      "version": "1.0"
    }
  }
}

### 12. 道具の一覧をもらう
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/jsonMcp-Session-Id: cd4f9d8d-11ab-4e39-b007-9d2bf78e12ca, text/event-stream


{ "jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list", "params": {} }

### 9. 道具を1つ呼んでみる
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: b7eb0ac4-08e0-43c9-bbe3-4bb4c15cdf3d
Mcp-Session-Id: e79bc302-8241-4b4d-847d-4ae6e23a1afc
{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "list_todos",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}
